# One chord keeps the Mac awake. The cup in the menu bar says so, its menu holds
# the rest, and the same chord lets it sleep again.
clock 10:12 · battery 72 · power ac · floor 15

caption "one chord keeps the Mac awake"
key
caption "the cup fills and burns: closing the lid won't sleep it"
@1100 open menu
@700 hover "Battery floor"
@1300 close menu

caption "the same chord lets it sleep again"
@900 key
